simple test for the board.


Prerequisites:

 - Set SEL_OUT (JP2) jumper to MISO mode


Effect:

Every LED will be set to white mode, R=G=B=1 (lowest brightness).

Then each LED will be cycled through green, red, blue brightness levels,
going back to R=G=B=1 mode. After 64th LED, cycle will continue from the
1st LED.

